{"2142380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Retro Drive: Revamped", "steam_appid": 2142380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [2635880, 2638360], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142380/extras/3c57d2f1e3bf5c8ab381fcd4d4ca6b2a.avif?t=1774605027\" width=640 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drive fast. Dodge everything. Don’t get caught.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Retro Drive: Revamped</i> is a <strong>fast-paced arcade driving game</strong> where precision and reflexes are everything. Tear through neon-lit highways, avoid deadly hazards, and outrun relentless police forces across a synthwave-fuelled city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142380/extras/3e47b3fa0a15f4bca4a027e3f64c4327.poster.avif?t=1774605027\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142380/extras/3e47b3fa0a15f4bca4a027e3f64c4327.webm?t=1774605027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142380/extras/3e47b3fa0a15f4bca4a027e3f64c4327.mp4?t=1774605027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the road:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚗 High-speed <strong>arcade driving challenges</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚓 <strong>Police chases</strong> that punish mistakes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ <strong>Deadly road hazards</strong> that demand precision</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏁 <strong>Time-attack tracks</strong> to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔧 <strong>Unlock and customise cars</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Retro Drive universe - a haven where the spirit of the 80s blazes with neon brilliance. Dash into a time-traveling vortex of neon lights and pulsating beats. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO RETROPOLIS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer the vibrant streets of Retropolis. Whether it's racing against the clock or evading the police, your skills will be put to the test. Turn the volume up, put the pedal to the metal, and race to catch up with your pals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142380/extras/1b33db944aaf98d13b69914048800b75.poster.avif?t=1774605027\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142380/extras/1b33db944aaf98d13b69914048800b75.webm?t=1774605027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142380/extras/1b33db944aaf98d13b69914048800b75.mp4?t=1774605027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142380/extras/a4845b2fe6a41c0b8c7ff30c4cf5ebec.avif?t=1774605027\" width=640 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RADICAL CARS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up your points as you race to unlock an array of customisable cars. The cooler your ride, the faster you'll tear through Retropolis. Cruise the neon-lit streets in style! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akama